{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_091_segformer-title\">SegFormer</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">层级 MiT 编码器结合 overlap patch、K/V 缩减 attention 与含 depthwise Conv 的 Mix-FFN，再接全 MLP 轻量 decoder。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Hierarchical Mix Transformer (MiT) encoder with overlapping patches, sequence-reduced attention, and 3×3 depthwise Mix-FFN paired with an all-MLP decoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">任意常见分辨率的 2D 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D image of arbitrary test resolution</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">全分辨率语义分割概率图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Full-resolution semantic segmentation probability map</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2021/hash/64f1f27bf1b4ec22924fd0acb550c235-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_091_segformer')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_091_segformer')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SegFormer original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/79a9dc5778f55b2c90a5.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_091_segformer\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_091_segformer')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_091_segformer\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">无需固定绝对位置编码尺寸</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image of arbitrary test resolution and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"无需固定绝对位置编码尺寸\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d image of arbitrary test resolution and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">无需固定绝对位置编码尺寸</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d image of arbitrary test resolution and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"带重叠的卷积式 patch embedding 保留局部连续性并逐级下采样\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Overlap Patch to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Overlap Patch\" data-node-name-en=\"Overlap Patch\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Overlap Patch</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">带重叠的卷积式 patch embedding 保留局部连续性并逐级下采样</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Overlap Patch to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 reduction ratio 压缩 K/V token 数，Q 保持当前 stage 分辨率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Efficient Attention within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Efficient Attention\" data-node-name-en=\"Efficient Attention\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Efficient Attention</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 reduction ratio 压缩 K/V token 数，Q 保持当前 stage 分辨率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Efficient Attention within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"MLP 中插入 3×3 depthwise Conv，引入局部位置偏置而不需显式位置编码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mix-FFN within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Mix-FFN\" data-node-name-en=\"Mix-FFN\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mix-FFN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">MLP 中插入 3×3 depthwise Conv，引入局部位置偏置而不需显式位置编码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mix-FFN within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重复 overlap embedding、efficient attention 与 Mix-FFN，通道递增\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MiT encoder within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"MiT 四级编码器\" data-node-name-en=\"MiT encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">MiT 四级编码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MiT encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重复 overlap embedding、efficient attention 与 Mix-FFN，通道递增</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MiT encoder within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从高分辨边界到低分辨语义的四级特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs multi-scale F1–F4 within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"多尺度 F1–F4\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-scale F1–F4\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多尺度 F1–F4</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-scale F1–F4</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从高分辨边界到低分辨语义的四级特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs multi-scale F1–F4 within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"各尺度独立线性投影到共同通道数并上采样到同一分辨率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MLP projection within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"MLP 投影\" data-node-name-en=\"MLP projection\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">MLP 投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MLP projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">各尺度独立线性投影到共同通道数并上采样到同一分辨率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MLP projection within the core hierarchical mit mlp segmentation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"concat 后用 MLP/1×1 Conv 融合，接 dropout 与分类层\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"轻量融合头\" data-node-name-en=\"fusion\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">轻量融合头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">concat 后用 MLP/1×1 Conv 融合，接 dropout 与分类层</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"上采样到输入大小的类别 logits/probabilities\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces full-resolution semantic segmentation probability map via Segmentation Map.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"分割图\" data-node-name-en=\"Segmentation Map\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_091_segformer', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分割图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Segmentation Map</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">上采样到输入大小的类别 logits/probabilities</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces full-resolution semantic segmentation probability map via Segmentation Map.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SegFormer Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 带局部卷积的 Mix-FFN 与多尺度 MLP 解码</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Position-Encoding-Free Mix-FFN &amp; Multi-Scale All-MLP Aggregation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"SegFormer：核心公式 · 带局部卷积的 Mix-FFN 与多尺度 MLP 解码\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"91\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height: